# This repo uses two env files (copy each .env.example → .env in the same folder):
#
#   frontend/.env   → VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (and other VITE_* only)
#   backend/.env    → GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, MONGO_URI, JWT_SECRET, etc.
#
# Both Google variables must be the same OAuth 2.0 Web client ID.
# Restart dev servers after any .env change.
